message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI Virtual Psyche Hotel"
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2025-08-12"
authors:
  - family-names: Baldwin-Ramult
    given-names: Leo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5122-0871"
    affiliation: "University of Auckland"
repository-code: "https://github.com/leverarchfile/ai-virtual-psyche-hotel"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A speculative web environment in which users check in to an online hotel by
  connecting data streams from their own rooms at home. An AI agent attempts to
  reconstruct the psychic interiority of each room's inhabitant as text that
  other guests encounter as they move through the hotel. Prototype developed
  as part of the AI Subjectivity project.
keywords:
  - creative AI
  - speculative design
  - net art
  - psychoanalysis
  - large language models
